조","x":1063,"y":725,"width":49,"height":27}]},{"text":"인되어 있고, 각 엔트리는 그 사용자의 UFD를 가리기고 있다(그림 13.8).","words":[{"text":"인되어","x":314,"y":853,"width":92,"height":36},{"text":"있고,","x":424,"y":853,"width":71,"height":35},{"text":"각","x":509,"y":853,"width":31,"height":35},{"text":"엔트리는","x":552,"y":853,"width":125,"height":36},{"text":"그","x":688,"y":858,"width":29,"height":24},{"text":"사용자의","x":728,"y":852,"width":117,"height":36},{"text":"UFD를","x":859,"y":854,"width":104,"height":34},{"text":"가리기고","x":976,"y":854,"width":120,"height":36},{"text":"있다(그림","x":1109,"y":854,"width":129,"height":38},{"text":"13.8).","x":1254,"y":857,"width":83,"height":34}]},{"text":"그 후 이 사용자가 특정한 파일을 시스템에 제시하면 그 UFD 디렉터리 밑에서만","words":[{"text":"그","x":373,"y":918,"width":32,"height":25},{"text":"후","x":421,"y":913,"width":33,"height":36},{"text":"이","x":471,"y":913,"width":26,"height":35},{"text":"사용자가","x":517,"y":913,"width":127,"height":36},{"text":"특정한","x":657,"y":913,"width":94,"height":36},{"text":"파일을","x":764,"y":912,"width":91,"height":36},{"text":"시스템에","x":870,"y":912,"width":118,"height":37},{"text":"제시하면","x":1007,"y":914,"width":119,"height":35},{"text":"그","x":1142,"y":917,"width":30,"height":25},{"text":"UFD","x":1186,"y":916,"width":76,"height":28},{"text":"디렉터리","x":1280,"y":912,"width":122,"height":36},{"text":"밑에서만","x":1423,"y":911,"width":128,"height":35}]},{"text":"탐색한다. 그러므로 UFD내에서 파일 이름이 유일하다면, 다른 사용자들이 동일한 이름","words":[{"text":"탐색한다.","x":312,"y":973,"width":137,"height":36},{"text":"그러므로","x":464,"y":972,"width":128,"height":36},{"text":"UFD내에서","x":604,"y":973,"width":164,"height":35},{"text":"파일","x":784,"y":972,"width":59,"height":36},{"text":"이름이","x":858,"y":972,"width":86,"height":36},{"text":"유일하다면,","x":960,"y":973,"width":159,"height":35},{"text":"다른","x":1134,"y":972,"width":60,"height":35},{"text":"사용자들이","x":1206,"y":971,"width":154,"height":37},{"text":"동일한","x":1376,"y":970,"width":99,"height":36},{"text":"이름","x":1488,"y":969,"width":64,"height":35}]},{"text":"의 파일을 가져도 상관이 없다. 파일의 생성 시 운영체제는 그 이름의 다른 파일이 이미","words":[{"text":"의","x":312,"y":1033,"width":28,"height":36},{"text":"파일을","x":357,"y":1032,"width":99,"height":36},{"text":"가져도","x":469,"y":1032,"width":95,"height":36},{"text":"상관이","x":577,"y":1033,"width":91,"height":35},{"text":"없다.","x":686,"y":1033,"width":65,"height":35},{"text":"파일의","x":766,"y":1032,"width":88,"height":36},{"text":"생성","x":870,"y":1032,"width":58,"height":35},{"text":"시","x":944,"y":1032,"width":25,"height":35},{"text":"운영체제는","x":985,"y":1032,"width":153,"height":36},{"text":"그","x":1150,"y":1036,"width":30,"height":24},{"text":"이름의","x":1194,"y":1032,"width":89,"height":34},{"text":"다른","x":1300,"y":1031,"width":64,"height":35},{"text":"파일이","x":1377,"y":1028,"width":93,"height":36},{"text":"이미","x":1488,"y":1027,"width":59,"height":35}]},{"text":"존재하는지를 확인하기 위해서 UFD만을 검색하기만 하면 된다. 파일의 삭제 시 운영체","words":[{"text":"존재하는지를","x":310,"y":1092,"width":197,"height":36},{"text":"확인하기","x":519,"y":1092,"width":122,"height":36},{"text":"위해서","x":659,"y":1092,"width":87,"height":35},{"text":"UFD만을","x":761,"y":1092,"width":137,"height":34},{"text":"검색하기만","x":910,"y":1091,"width":152,"height":36},{"text":"하면","x":1073,"y":1091,"width":59,"height":35},{"text":"된다.","x":1145,"y":1090,"width":67,"height":36},{"text":"파일의","x":1226,"y":1090,"width":92,"height":35},{"text":"삭제","x":1334,"y":1088,"width":61,"height":35},{"text":"시","x":1412,"y":1087,"width":27,"height":35},{"text":"운영체","x":1454,"y":1085,"width":94,"height":36}]},{"text":"제는 지역적인 UFD내에서 검색하므로, 동일한 이름의 다른 사용자의 파일을 삭제할 수","words":[{"text":"제는","x":312,"y":1153,"width":64,"height":34},{"text":"지역적인","x":390,"y":1151,"width":127,"height":36},{"text":"UFD내에서","x":530,"y":1152,"width":168,"height":35},{"text":"검색하므로,","x":715,"y":1151,"width":159,"height":36},{"text":"동일한","x":887,"y":1151,"width":93,"height":36},{"text":"이름의","x":992,"y":1151,"width":86,"height":36},{"text":"다른","x":1094,"y":1150,"width":61,"height":36},{"text":"사용자의","x":1166,"y":1150,"width":120,"height":35},{"text":"파일을","x":1302,"y":1148,"width":97,"height":36},{"text":"삭제할","x":1411,"y":1145,"width":97,"height":36},{"text":"수","x":1518,"y":1145,"width":34,"height":35}]},{"text":"없다.","words":[{"text":"없다.","x":313,"y":1212,"width":69,"height":35}]},{"text":"이렇게 되려면 물론 시스템은 각 사용자를 위한 UFD를 만들고 없앨 수 있어야 한","words":[{"text":"이렇게","x":373,"y":1270,"width":93,"height":36},{"text":"되려면","x":484,"y":1270,"width":94,"height":35},{"text":"물론","x":593,"y":1272,"width":63,"height":34},{"text":"시스템은","x":670,"y":1270,"width":124,"height":36},{"text":"각","x":808,"y":1271,"width":30,"height":34},{"text":"사용자를","x":850,"y":1271,"width":124,"height":35},{"text":"위한","x":988,"y":1270,"width":61,"height":36},{"text":"UFD를","x":1060,"y":1271,"width":106,"height":33},{"text":"만들고","x":1179,"y":1270,"width":93,"height":34},{"text":"없앨","x":1288,"y":1268,"width":60,"height":35},{"text":"수","x":1362,"y":1267,"width":34,"height":35},{"text":"있어야","x":1412,"y":1265,"width":94,"height":37},{"text":"한","x":1519,"y":1264,"width":33,"height":35}]},{"text":"다. 이를 위해서는 적정한 사용자 이름과 회계 정보를 가지고 특수 시스템 프로그램을","words":[{"text":"다.","x":310,"y":1330,"width":39,"height":35},{"text":"이를","x":369,"y":1330,"width":63,"height":36},{"text":"위해서는","x":449,"y":1329,"width":129,"height":36},{"text":"적정한","x":593,"y":1330,"width":94,"height":35},{"text":"사용자","x":700,"y":1329,"width":94,"height":36},{"text":"이름과","x":810,"y":1330,"width":92,"height":36},{"text":"회계","x":917,"y":1330,"width":57,"height":35},{"text":"정보를","x":993,"y":1330,"width":90,"height":35},{"text":"가지고","x":1098,"y":1329,"width":91,"height":36},{"text":"특수","x":1202,"y":1329,"width":65,"height":34},{"text":"시스템","x":1281,"y":1328,"width":91,"height":35},{"text":"프로그램을","x":1390,"y":1325,"width":162,"height":35}]},{"text":"수행한다. 이 프로그램은 새로운 UFD를 생성하고 MFD에 그 항을 추가한다. 이 프로그","words":[{"text":"수행한다.","x":309,"y":1389,"width":137,"height":35},{"text":"이","x":463,"y":1389,"width":27,"height":35},{"text":"프로그램은","x":505,"y":1389,"width":159,"height":35},{"text":"새로운","x":674,"y":1389,"width":94,"height":35},{"text":"UFD를","x":778,"y":1392,"width":107,"height":32},{"text":"생성하고","x":896,"y":1390,"width":122,"height":36},{"text":"MFD에","x":1028,"y":1389,"width":109,"height":35},{"text":"그","x":1150,"y":1393,"width":32,"height":24},{"text":"항을","x":1192,"y":1388,"width":63,"height":36},{"text":"추가한다.","x":1265,"y":1386,"width":133,"height":36},{"text":"이","x":1413,"y":1386,"width":27,"height":36},{"text":"프로그","x":1454,"y":1389,"width":97,"height":27}]},{"text":"램의 수행은 일반 사용자에게는 금지되어야 하고 시스템 관리자(system administra-","words":[{"text":"램의","x":312,"y":1449,"width":59,"height":35},{"text":"수행은","x":389,"y":1449,"width":99,"height":35},{"text":"일반","x":505,"y":1448,"width":62,"height":35},{"text":"사용자에게는","x":580,"y":1448,"width":188,"height":37},{"text":"금지되어야","x":782,"y":1449,"width":157,"height":37},{"text":"하고","x":952,"y":1450,"width":61,"height":36},{"text":"시스템","x":1027,"y":1449,"width":88,"height":36},{"text":"관리자(system","x":1132,"y":1448,"width":215,"height":40},{"text":"administra-","x":1362,"y":1449,"width":190,"height":29}]},{"text":"tor)만이 가능해야 할 것이다. 사용자 디렉터리를 위한 디스크 공간 할당은 124장에서","words":[{"text":"tor)만이","x":309,"y":1508,"width":122,"height":38},{"text":"가능해야","x":451,"y":1508,"width":128,"height":36},{"text":"할","x":592,"y":1508,"width":34,"height":35},{"text":"것이다.","x":640,"y":1508,"width":99,"height":36},{"text":"사용자","x":756,"y":1508,"width":94,"height":36},{"text":"디렉터리를","x":865,"y":1509,"width":153,"height":36},{"text":"위한","x":1033,"y":1509,"width":62,"height":35},{"text":"디스크","x":1109,"y":1508,"width":91,"height":36},{"text":"공간","x":1214,"y":1507,"width":63,"height":36},{"text":"할당은","x":1290,"y":1507,"width":96,"height":35},{"text":"124장에서","x":1401,"y":1506,"width":147,"height":37}]},{"text":"논의될 파일 자신을 위한 기법으로 처리될 수 있다.","words":[{"text":"논의될","x":309,"y":1568,"width":96,"height":34},{"text":"파일","x":419,"y":1567,"width":63,"height":36},{"text":"자신을","x":496,"y":1568,"width":95,"height":35},{"text":"위한","x":603,"y":1568,"width":63,"height":36},{"text":"기법으로","x":677,"y":1568,"width":123,"height":36},{"text":"처리될","x":813,"y":1568,"width":91,"height":37},{"text":"수","x":915,"y":1570,"width":32,"height":35},{"text":"있다.","x":960,"y":1570,"width":65,"height":36}]},{"text":"2단계 디렉터리 구조는 파일 이름이 충돌하는 문제는 어느 정도 해결하였으나 다른","words":[{"text":"2단계","x":370,"y":1627,"width":82,"height":35},{"text":"디렉터리","x":469,"y":1627,"width":123,"height":36},{"text":"구조는","x":608,"y":1630,"width":95,"height":33},{"text":"파일","x":715,"y":1628,"width":60,"height":35},{"text":"이름이","x":792,"y":1628,"width":88,"height":36},{"text":"충돌하는","x":895,"y":1630,"width":125,"height":35},{"text":"문제는","x":1031,"y":1629,"width":93,"height":35},{"text":"어느","x":1137,"y":1629,"width":61,"height":35},{"text":"정도","x":1211,"y":1628,"width":62,"height":36},{"text":"해결하였으나","x":1286,"y":1627,"width":190,"height":36},{"text":"다른","x":1489,"y":1628,"width":65,"height":36}]},{"text":"문제를 새로 제기한다. 이 구조에서는 한 사\u0026자의 UFD를 다른 사용자가 액세스할 수","words":[{"text":"문제를","x":309,"y":1687,"width":99,"height":35},{"text":"새로","x":422,"y":1687,"width":65,"height":36},{"text":"제기한다.","x":502,"y":1687,"width":133,"height":36},{"text":"이","x":653,"y":1688,"width":26,"height":36},{"text":"구조에서는","x":696,"y":1688,"width":157,"height":37},{"text":"한","x":865,"y":1689,"width":31,"height":35},{"text":"사\u0026자의","x":909,"y":1689,"width":120,"height":37},{"text":"UFD를","x":1044,"y":1691,"width":107,"height":33},{"text":"다른","x":1165,"y":1689,"width":62,"height":35},{"text":"사용자가","x":1240,"y":1688,"width":127,"height":36},{"text":"액세스할","x":1381,"y":1688,"width":128,"height":35},{"text":"수","x":1520,"y":1689,"width":34,"height":36}]},{"text":"없으므로 장점이 되지만 두 사용자가 한 파일을 공유해서 사용해야 하는 경우는 문제가","words":[{"text":"없으므로","x":313,"y":1746,"width":129,"height":35},{"text":"장점이","x":455,"y":1747,"width":92,"height":36},{"text":"되지만","x":565,"y":1747,"width":95,"height":36},{"text":"두","x":672,"y":1751,"width":31,"height":33},{"text":"사용자가","x":716,"y":1748,"width":124,"height":36},{"text":"한","x":853,"y":1749,"width":31,"height":35},{"text":"파일을","x":896,"y":1750,"width":93,"height":34},{"text":"공유해서","x":1000,"y":1750,"width":119,"height":35},{"text":"사용해야","x":1136,"y":1749,"width":126,"height":36},{"text":"하는","x":1274,"y":1749,"width":63,"height":35},{"text":"경우는","x":1351,"y":1749,"width":94,"height":35},{"text":"문제가","x":1456,"y":1749,"width":99,"height":35}]},{"text":"발생한다. 서로가 자신의 UFD 접근을 허용하지 않으면 공유는 불/卜능할 것이다.","words":[{"text":"발생한다.","x":312,"y":1806,"width":137,"height":36},{"text":"서로가","x":465,"y":1807,"width":95,"height":35},{"text":"자신의","x":570,"y":1807,"width":92,"height":37},{"text":"UFD","x":676,"y":1812,"width":75,"height":28},{"text":"접근을","x":765,"y":1808,"width":91,"height":35},{"text":"허용하지","x":867,"y":1809,"width":119,"height":36},{"text":"않으면","x":1001,"y":1809,"width":91,"height":36},{"text":"공유는","x":1103,"y":1810,"width":94,"height":35},{"text":"불/卜능할","x":1207,"y":1809,"width":127,"height":35},{"text":"것이다.","x":1345,"y":1808,"width":100,"height":36}]},{"text":"접근이 허용된다면, 한 사용자가 다른 사용자의 디렉터리에 있는 파일을 지칭할 수","words":[{"text":"접근이","x":376,"y":1866,"width":91,"height":35},{"text":"허용된다면,","x":487,"y":1866,"width":164,"height":38},{"text":"한","x":666,"y":1868,"width":33,"height":34},{"text":"사용자가","x":711,"y":1868,"width":125,"height":36},{"text":"다른","x":848,"y":1869,"width":63,"height":35},{"text":"사용자의","x":923,"y":1869,"width":120,"height":36},{"text":"디렉터리에","x":1061,"y":1868,"width":150,"height":36},{"text":"있는","x":1230,"y":1869,"width":61,"height":35},{"text":"파일을","x":1304,"y":1869,"width":95,"height":35},{"text":"지칭할","x":1413,"y":1868,"width":95,"height":36},{"text":"수","x":1521,"y":1870,"width":33,"height":34}]},{"text":"있어야 한다. 2단계 디렉터리에서 특정 파일을 유일하게 지칭하기 위해서는 반드시 사용","words":[{"text":"있어야","x":316,"y":1925,"width":96,"height":36},{"text":"한다.","x":424,"y":1926,"width":71,"height":35},{"tex